# Build context for the API image. Everything here is either rebuilt inside the image or is local
# state that must not travel: a smaller context is a faster upload, and uploads/ holds customer
# media that has no business being copied into an image layer.

target/
uploads/

.git/
.github/
.idea/
*.iml

# The Maven wrapper and the local test scripts are development tools; the build stage uses the
# Maven that ships in the builder image.
.mvn/
mvnw
mvnw.cmd
scripts/

docker-compose.yml
HELP.md
README.md

# Nothing below is needed at build time, and .env style files must never enter an image layer.
.env
.env.*
